 "text": {
  "title": "Riverlock Crossing",
  "body": "Corrupt canal mercenaries led by the brutal Lockmaster have seized the twin parallel riverlocks controlling Harborwatch's freshwater supply, extorting silver for every ship cask. Capture both northern lock banks and overthrow the Lockmaster before he cranks open the sluice torrents.",
  "obj.0": "Capture the West Riverlock bank",
  "obj.1": "Capture the East Riverlock bank",
  "obj.2": "Defeat the Lockmaster command on the northern heights",
  "msg.1": "The Lockmaster extorts silver for every freshwater cask while the evacuation ships wait dry at the piers. Seize both riverlocks before he cranks open the sluice gates!",
  "msg.1.who": "Bridgewright Hal",
  "msg.2": "The West Riverlock is secured; an ironbound toll vault holding four hundred and fifty silver coins is pried from the masonry!",
  "msg.2.who": "Bridgewright Hal",
  "msg.3": "The East Riverlock falls; our halberdiers crack the Lockmaster's strongbox for four hundred and fifty crowns!",
  "msg.3.who": "Bridgewright Hal",
  "msg.4": "The Lockmaster crashes onto the sluice stones! Clean freshwater pours back into Harborwatch's cisterns for the voyage west!",
  "msg.4.who": "Bridgewright Hal",
  "win": "Both riverlocks are reclaimed and Harborwatch's ship casks fill with fresh water.",
  "fail.1": "Your hero fell at Riverlock Crossing."
 },
